AY CTR
AN Example CTR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
V X=46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DC 2.5
AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR 2
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DC 5
AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR 3
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DY 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DY 46:00:00N 015:00:00E
